# Your source images. Big, and not what is published — `poolctl import` normalises them into
# images/ and the manifest names those. Keep the originals wherever you like; this is only the
# default place images.toml points at.
originals/*
!originals/.gitkeep

# Written by poolctl. images/ holds the normalised PNGs, catalogue.json their provenance.
images/
catalogue.json
